<div class="row">
	<div class="col">

		<div class="list-group list-group-flush">
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 07/10/2026 12:47 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/68966">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - Preliminary business results in Q3 2026.</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">Business indicators after nine months confirm expectations for business development in 2026. Compared to the same period in 2025, enasolAuto doo, which owns Qelo brand has had another strong quarter and growth in all key business segments.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-94f3093a5c4c53433eefa9749d0604e8.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-94f3093a5c4c53433eefa9749d0604e8" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 08/09/2026 15:08 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/68647">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - Business results in the first eight months of 2026.</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">All segments grew between two and three times, with the growth in energy delivered on Qelo ultra-fast chargers in MWh being 4.16 times higher than last year. Total revenues for July and August 2026 are higher than the total revenues generated in 2025. The company confirms its revenue expectations in the range of €1.2 million to €1.6 million.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-5ba4d1b2d48ccc31f4631fdd070dcb2f.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-5ba4d1b2d48ccc31f4631fdd070dcb2f" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 07/07/2026 11:20 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/67631">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - Business results in H1 2026. and increase in revenue expectations for 2026.</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">Revenue generated from Qelo users increased from EUR 110.84 thousand in the first half of 2025 to EUR 227.35 thousand in the same period of 2026, which represents an increase of 105 percent . At the time of publishing this report, the Company is changing its revenue expectations from the range of €1.1 million to €1.5 million and increasing them to the range of €1.2 million to €1.6 million.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-8a5535ba17400a43dcf92991d9da9ab8.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-8a5535ba17400a43dcf92991d9da9ab8" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 30/06/2026 14:13 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/67550">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - Business results in 2025 and expectations for 2026.</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">In 2025, the company enasolAuto doo under the commercial trademark Qelo achieved significant revenue growth. At the end of the year, the audited revenues of the Company amounted to EUR 562,797.00, which is a 176% increase compared to 2024, when the revenues were EUR 203,362.00.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-e21b96813e4873800000be8057c56541.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-e21b96813e4873800000be8057c56541" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 15/06/2026 13:52 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/67363">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - Establishment of the company Qelo Imovina d.o.o.</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">enasolAuto d.o.o. has established the company Qelo Imovina d.o.o. which is 100% owned by enasolAuto d.o.o.. The purpose of establishing the company is to be an SPV through which CAPEX will be financed for the construction of the Qelo charging network in the future period.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-948310f6e07b6e01ae3a2a4713111c53.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-948310f6e07b6e01ae3a2a4713111c53" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 18/05/2026 11:45 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/67000">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> GLUCODENT d.o.o. - Glucodent d.o.o. has signed an agreement with the laboratory within KBC Rebro Zagreb regarding biochemical analyses</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">Glucodent has signed a clinical study agreement with KB Vuk Vrhovec, The University of Zagreb School of Dental Medicine, and now also with the laboratory within KBC Rebro Zagreb. This agreement enables the obtaining of approvals for conducting the clinical study in which the medical device will be tested.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/GLCO/COI-GLCO-8998cff6a7fd33069a78e0ffd43907a3.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-GLCO-8998cff6a7fd33069a78e0ffd43907a3" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 29/04/2026 15:39 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/66528">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - Business results in Q1 2026 and expectations for 2026.</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">The first quarter of 2026 was a record for the number of fillings and revenues for the first quarter of the year.  At this time, the Company remains committed to its revenue projection for 2026. In 2026, the Company expects revenues in the range of €1.1 million – €1.5 million. This means an increase in revenue of 2 to 2.6 times higher than the previous business year.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-e86cf1bb025d942b1b7183963bb15fb5.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-e86cf1bb025d942b1b7183963bb15fb5" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 31/03/2026 16:04 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Inside information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/65740">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - Notice of Share Sale</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">enasolAuto d.o.o., as the owner of the Qelo brand and electric vehicle charging system, hereby informs the market that a process has been initiated for the sale of a 10% ownership stake in enasolAuto d.o.o.
An existing shareholder (Enasol d.o.o.) is selling its 10% stake to a special purpose vehicle (SPV – Qorex One d.o.o.).</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-c8efd7ec94c6e77c4fb2113836561594.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-c8efd7ec94c6e77c4fb2113836561594" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 10/03/2026 14:30 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/65471">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - enasolAuto has changed its businiess residence</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">enasolAuto has changed its business residence. The new adress is: 
enasolAuto d.o.o. 
Selska cesta 136 
10000 Zagreb
Republika Hrvatska</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-bdc0ba40c21b6603f560f63768be6b30.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-bdc0ba40c21b6603f560f63768be6b30" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 23/02/2026 07:44 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/64915">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> enasolAuto d.o.o. - Business results in  2025. and guidance for2026.</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">Business results in  2025. and guidance for2026.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/ENAS/COI-ENAS-fbcf428194c7231eb232493a14237eb8.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-ENAS-fbcf428194c7231eb232493a14237eb8" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 28/07/2025 08:45 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Inside information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/62402">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> GLUCODENT d.o.o. - Glucodent has submitted second patent to the European patent office</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">Glucodent Ltd. has, through the company Maiwald GmbH, submitted its second patent
application to the European Patent Office in order to protect its intellectual property.
By submitting this second patent application, the prerequisites for the next phase of product
development—clinical trials—have been established.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/GLCO/COI-GLCO-217a7563ebc095fd0f5e33d8fe839e45.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-GLCO-217a7563ebc095fd0f5e33d8fe839e45" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 13/05/2025 12:01 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Other information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/61469">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> GLUCODENT d.o.o. - Capital increase</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">&quot;GLUCODENT d.o.o., hereby notifies that on May 9, 2025, an increase in the Company’s share capital was registered in
the court register of the Commercial Court in Zagreb — from the amount of EUR 7,590.00, by an amount of EUR 410.00, to a total of EUR 8,000.00, fully paid in cash.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/GLCO/COI-GLCO-e1660a6bad7f4d367ed169c673b6517b.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-GLCO-e1660a6bad7f4d367ed169c673b6517b" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 04/04/2025 14:19 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Inside information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/60120">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> GLUCODENT d.o.o. - Glucodent has submitted a patent to European patent office</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">Glucodent Ltd, through the company Maiwald GmbH, has submitted a patent application to the European Patent Office to protect its intellectual property for a synthesized molecule that forms the foundation of Glucodent’s future medical product.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/GLCO/COI-GLCO-c70b761d120dfac5b1481c9e75d9475f.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-GLCO-c70b761d120dfac5b1481c9e75d9475f" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 15/10/2024 13:24 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Inside information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/57499">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> GLUCODENT d.o.o. - Examination of the Effect of the Active Pharmaceutical Ingredient</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">Glucodent Ltd. has successfully completed the examination of the effect of the API on the growth and development (proliferation) of pathogenic bacteria in the oral cavity with positive results.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/GLCO/COI-GLCO-bc1511cc0194031ca9119a1c0d746128.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-GLCO-bc1511cc0194031ca9119a1c0d746128" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
						</p>
					
				</div>
			
				<div class="row pt-1"></div>
				<div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action">
					<p class="mb-1"><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 23/09/2024 11:14 
						<span class="text-muted">&ndash; Inside information</span>
					</p>
					
					
					<div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
						<a href="/en/issuer-announcements/view/57260">
							<h4 class="fw-light"><i class="far fa-newspaper"></i> GLUCODENT d.o.o. - Examination of the Effect of the Active Pharmaceutical Ingredient (API) on Artificial Saliva pH</h4>
						</a>
					</div>
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1 text-truncate">Glucodent Ltd. has successfully completed the examination of the effect of the API on the pH of artificial saliva. 
The results obtained show that the action of the API exceeds the initial goals set by the scientists involved in the development of the GLUCODENT© product.</p>
					
					
						<p class="mt-1 mb-1">
						
								<a href="/fileadmin/issuers/GLCO/COI-GLCO-e7f547b1939ac8ebf55127d5592152e2.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" download="COI-GLCO-e7f547b1939ac8ebf55127d5592152e2" role="button"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download document</a>
							
